        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Prince William, Duke of Gloucester; Prince George of Denmark and Norway; Princess Anne; Queen Anne\n- Roles: Duke of Gloucester; Duke of Cumberland; Queen of England, Ireland and Scotland; Queen of Great Britain\n- Places: England; Ireland; Scotland; Great Britain; Denmark; Norway\n\nFacts:\n- Prince George of Denmark and Norway, Duke of Cumberland, was born on 2 April 1653 and died on 28 October 1708.\n- Prince William, Duke of Gloucester, was born on 24 July 1689 and died on 30 July 1700.\n- Prince William, Duke of Gloucester, was the son of Princess Anne and her husband, Prince George, Duke of Cumberland.\n- Princess Anne became Queen of England, Ireland and Scotland in 1702.\n- Prince George of Denmark and Norway, Duke of Cumberland, was the husband of Queen Anne.\n- Queen Anne reigned over Great Britain from 1702.",
